# Arguments of the couli-only vmalert (B1-25b), one -flag=value per line. It evaluates only the couli
# rule files (Pigsty's vmalert keeps /infra/rules), reads the node's VictoriaMetrics and notifies only
# the couli Alertmanager of B1-25a (127.0.0.1:9093). 30s is below every rule's for: (5m).
-rule=/opt/couli/alerting/rules/couli.yaml
-rule=/opt/couli/alerting/rules/couli-fund.yaml
-datasource.url=http://127.0.0.1:8428
-remoteRead.url=http://127.0.0.1:8428
-remoteWrite.url=http://127.0.0.1:8428
-notifier.url=http://127.0.0.1:9093
-evaluationInterval=30s
-httpListenAddr=127.0.0.1:8881
